      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "013.php 修改密码处 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过修改密码表单提交新口令，输入在 013.php:8 被读取为 `password_new`，随后在 013.php:26 仅经过 `mysqli_real_escape_string()` 转义，在 013.php:27 被 `md5()` 处理，最终在 013.php:30 被直接拼接进 UPDATE 语句 `UPDATE `users` SET password = '$pass_new' WHERE user = '...' LIMIT 1;`，并在 013.php:31 交给 `mysqli_query()` 执行。由于 `$pass_new` 是字符串拼接而非参数化查询，转义函数无法覆盖所有上下文（如多字节字符集/引号处理不当），且 md5 后的值仍以字符串形式拼入 SQL，攻击者可构造闭合单引号的输入改变查询语义。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60",
            "confidence": 0.4,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/013",
            "http_method": "POST",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/captcha_bypass",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "DVWA 密码修改接口 CAPTCHA 校验可被硬编码值 + User-Agent 伪造绕过\n\n013.php 第 17-23 行的 CAPTCHA 判定条件为 `$resp || ($_POST['g-recaptcha-response'] == 'hidd3n_valu3' && $_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'] == 'reCAPTCHA')`。攻击者无需真正通过 reCAPTCHA，只要提交固定字符串 `hidd3n_valu3` 并把 User-Agent 头设为 `reCAPTCHA`，即可让整个条件恒真，进入第 25 行的密码修改分支，把当前用户密码改为攻击者指定值（第 26-31 行 UPDATE users SET password=md5(...)）。这使 CAPTCHA 这一唯一的人机/暴力破解防护完全失效，可被脚本化批量调用，配合 CSRF 缺失（第 52-53 行仅在页面渲染时生成 token，POST 处理分支未校验 token）可导致账户接管。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 17,
                  "endLine": 23
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "LLM-719de589f39a"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "LLM-719de589f39a",
            "confidence": 0.93,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "llm_inferred",
            "cwe": "CWE-804",
            "endpoint": "/vulnerabilities/captcha/",
            "http_method": "POST",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "llm_finding"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/captcha_bypass",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "013.php 修改密码流程验证码可绕过（CWE-804）\n\n013.php:3 判断 `isset($_POST['Change'])` 后，在 013.php:4-5 直接设置 `$hide_form = true` 并进入修改密码逻辑，代码片段中未见对验证码值的服务端校验或一次性令牌绑定。攻击者可直接构造包含 Change 字段的 POST 请求跳过验证码步骤，直接提交口令修改。"
          },
          "locations": [
